# Configuration form — Fast Enrichment (kernel-aware companion).
# Wired from QuickLogBuilder.WithFastEnrichment(LogProperty[]).

columns: 12

[container("Fast Enrichment", "Static-value property enrichment on the kernel path. Use for host.name / service.name / deployment.environment — fields whose value is constant for a process lifetime. Three statics on every event: ~138 ns / 136 B vs ~939 ns / 1832 B on the chain enricher.")]

